<title>UK: 600 Group sells subsidiary to Coherent.</title>
<headline>600 Group sells subsidiary to Coherent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 600 Group Plc said on Monday that it is selling Ealing Electro-Optics and its U.S. subsidiary Ealing Electro-Optics Inc for around six million stg to the UK trading division of Coherent Inc.</p>
<p>The machine tools firm said in a statement it will invest some of the proceeds in the expansion of its international machine tool distribution network. The remainder will be used as working capital for an expanded product development programme.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
